stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> provisioned: platform_owner or platform_admin creates Customer Account
    provisioned --> active: onboarding complete
    active --> suspended: risk, abuse, contract hold outside RBAC, customer request
    suspended --> active: remediation approved
    active --> offboarding: tenant_owner request or platform decision
    suspended --> offboarding: exit after suspension
    offboarding --> revoked: retention/export checklist complete
    revoked --> [*]

    provisioned: login limited
    provisioned: no production agent registration
    active: normal tenant operations
    active: users, services, policies, agents, snapshots
    suspended: mutation blocked
    suspended: audit/read-only by policy
    offboarding: export and cleanup only
    revoked: no tenant operations

    note right of provisioned
        Every transition requires actor,
        reason and audit event.
    end note

    note right of suspended
        Platform support access remains
        time-bound, reason-required
        and audited.
    end note
